t-link-type="pubmed">481&#x02013;484</related-article>.</p><p>On p. 483, an error appears in the subheading of the middle column. The correct subheading should read as follows.</p><p>&#x0201c;Applications to biology&#x02014;single molecules to single cells&#x0201d;</p><p>The error appears only in the printed version of this article. The online version was corrected on 08/23/2006.</p></body></article>